    "content": "### Duchess Flame Event Drop Rate Master Guide\n\nEvery public event and seasonal festival in Fallout 76 utilizes specific loot tables. Here is the verified datamined breakdown:\n\n#### Seasonal Events\n* **Fasnacht Night**:\n  * **Glowing / Glowing Ultra-Rare Masks**: **0.238% drop rate** per mask (5% total pool across all rare masks when all 5 protectrons survive).\n  * **Common / Uncommon Masks**: 95% total pool.\n* **Mothman Equinox**:\n  * Cultist High Priest Packs drop Cultist Monarch, Cultist Elder, and Sacred Tome plans (Increases XP gain by +5%).\n* **Invaders from Beyond**:\n  * Alien Blaster Poison/Cryo Receiver, Alien Disintegrator, Electro Enforcer plans (1.5% drop rate per plan).\n* **Meat Week**:\n  * Pepper Shaker Plan (2.25%), Meat Tenderizer (2.25%), Chally the Moo-Moo Outfit (6.25%).\n\n#### Ultra-Rare Savage Divide Bundle (0.15% Drop Rate)\nCompleting *One Violent Night*, *Guided Meditation*, *Uranium Fever*, or *Strange Bedfellows* has a **0.15% chance** to reward the entire Savage Divide Apparel Bundle:\n1. **Forrest Camo Jumpsuit**\n2. **BOS Jumpsuit**\n3. **White Powder Jumpsuit**\n4. **Urban Scout Armor Mask**\n5. **Forest Scout Armor Mask**\n"
