    "content": "### Minerva Sales & Rotation Guide\n\nMinerva is a traveling Gold Bullion merchant who sells rare plans at a **25% discount** compared to standard faction vendors (Mortimer, Samuel, Regs).\n\n#### Schedule Cycle\n* **Minerva's Weekly Sale**: Runs Monday 12:00 PM EST to Wednesday 12:00 PM EST. Rotates between **Foundation**, **Crater**, and **Fort Atlas**.\n* **Minerva's Big Sale**: Runs Thursday 12:00 PM EST to Monday 12:00 PM EST at the end of every 3-week cycle. Features all plans from the previous 3 rotations combined.\n\n#### Top High-Priority Plans\n1. **Secret Service Armor** (Chest, Limbs, Jet Pack): 25% discount off Regs' price.\n2. **Gauss Shotgun & Gauss Minigun** Mods: Skip reputation grind with Crater/Foundation.\n3. **Covert Scout Armor**: Daily Ops plan fallback.\n4. **Crusader Pistol & Plasma Caster Mods**: High-tier ranged additions.\n5. **War Glaive & Plasma Cutter Mods**: High-tier melee additions.\n"
